cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Demo 22: Agent Memory Leakage (teaching toy)"
message: >-
  If you use this teaching demo in coursework, please cite it as below.
  All entries and verdicts are synthetic; this is not research
  evidence.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Radanliev
    given-names: Petar
license: MIT
keywords:
